<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="hero-unbrew">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1 style="font-size: 5.5rem;">Turn your skills into <span style="color: var(--warning-color);">credit</span>, your credit into <span style="color: var(--secondary-color);">change</span>.</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.5rem; max-width: 90%;">Where every skill counts and every help builds a better community. Join the new economy where time is the ultimate currency.</p>
    
    <div class="d-flex gap-4 mt-5">
      <a href="/auth/signup" class="btn primary-btn" style="background: white; color: var(--primary-color); font-size: 1.2rem; padding: 1.2rem 2.5rem;">Start A Project <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right"></i></a>
      <a href="/auth/login" class="btn" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color: white; font-size: 1.2rem; padding: 1.2rem 2.5rem;">Log In Now</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-illustration">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Team Collaboration" style="width: 100%; max-width: 800px; border-radius: 30px; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4); border: 5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);">
  </div>
</div>

<div id="features" style="background: var(--card-bg); padding: 6rem 5%;">
  <div class="d-flex align-items-center" style="gap: 5rem;">
    <!-- Left Intro Text -->
    <div style="flex: 1; max-width: 450px;">
      <span class="badge badge-primary mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> HOW IT WORKS</span>
      <h2 style="font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 900; margin: 1rem 0; line-height: 1.1;">We Provide A Lot of Cool Services</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Offer your unique skills, request help when you need it, and earn rewards all in one seamless platform. TimeBank connects you with people who have exactly what you need.</p>
      <a href="/auth/signup" class="btn primary-btn" style="padding: 1.2rem 2.5rem; font-size: 1.1rem;">Explore All Services</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Right Grid Cards -->
    <div style="flex: 1.5;">
      <div class="grid-2">
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <div class="card feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-hand-holding-heart"></i></div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 800;">Offer Help</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-muted);">Use your skills to help others in your community. Whether it's coding, plumbing, or teaching, someone needs you.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <div class="card feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1); color: var(--warning-color);"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn"></i></div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 800;">Request Help</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-muted);">Post tasks you need done. Pay only with your earned TimeBank credits, not cash.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <div class="card feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1); color: var(--success-color);"><i class="fa-solid fa-gift"></i></div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 800;">Earn Rewards</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-muted);">Exchange your hard-earned credits for exclusive coupons and real-world discounts in our Reward Store.</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Card 4 -->
        <div class="card feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1); color: var(--secondary-color);"><i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i></div>
          <h3 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 800;">Build Community</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-muted);">Connect with locals, make friends, and build a reputation based on trust and mutual assistance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="testimonials" style="background: var(--bg-app); padding: 6rem 5% 10rem 5%;">
  <div class="text-center" style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <span class="badge badge-warning mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i> TESTIMONIALS</span>
    <h2 style="font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 900;">Success Stories</h2>
    <p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 1.2rem;">See how TimeBank is changing lives across the globe.</p>
  </div>
  
  <div class="grid-3">
    <div class="card" style="padding: 4rem 3rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; border: none; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-right" style="position: absolute; top: -10px; right: -10px; font-size: 8rem; color: var(--primary-color); opacity: 0.03;"></i>
      <div style="color: var(--warning-color); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i></div>
      <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-weight: 500; position: relative; z-index: 2;">"I helped someone fix their code and got 20 credits – then I used them to get gardening help! It's an incredible cycle of giving and receiving."</p>
      <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mt-auto position-relative" style="z-index: 2;">
        <img src="https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=Alex+M&background=0D8ABC&color=fff" style="width: 55px; height: 55px; border-radius: 50%;">
        <div><h4 style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem;">Alex M.</h4><span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Software Developer</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="card" style="padding: 4rem 3rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; border: none; border-top: 5px solid var(--primary-color); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); transform: translateY(-10px);">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-right" style="position: absolute; top: -10px; right: -10px; font-size: 8rem; color: var(--primary-color); opacity: 0.03;"></i>
      <div style="color: var(--warning-color); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i></div>
      <p style="font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-weight: 600; position: relative; z-index: 2;">"Time is free, but it’s priceless. You can’t own it, but you can use it. Once you’ve lost it, you can never get it back."</p>
      <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mt-auto position-relative" style="z-index: 2;">
        <div style="width: 55px; height: 55px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1); color: var(--primary-color); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size: 1.5rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-book"></i></div>
        <div><h4 style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem;">Harvey Mackay</h4><span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Author</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="card" style="padding: 4rem 3rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; border: none; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-quote-right" style="position: absolute; top: -10px; right: -10px; font-size: 8rem; color: var(--primary-color); opacity: 0.03;"></i>
      <div style="color: var(--warning-color); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i></div>
      <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-weight: 500; position: relative; z-index: 2;">"Alone we can do so little; together we can do so much. TimeBank proves this every single day in my local neighborhood."</p>
      <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mt-auto position-relative" style="z-index: 2;">
        <div style="width: 55px; height: 55px; border-radius: 50%; background: #e2e8f0; color: var(--text-muted); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size: 1.5rem;"><i class="fa-solid fa-pen-nib"></i></div>
        <div><h4 style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.1rem;">Helen Keller</h4><span style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">Author & Activist</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

